{"1":{"w":[{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"When"},{"c":"زُلْزِلَتِ","d":"zul'zilati","e":"is shaken"},{"c":"الْأَرْضُ","d":"l-arḍu","e":"the earth"},{"c":"زِلْزَالَهَا","d":"zil'zālahā","e":"with its earthquake"}],"a":{"g":"When the earth is shaken with its [final] earthquake"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَخْرَجَتِ","d":"wa-akhrajati","e":"And brings forth"},{"c":"الْأَرْضُ","d":"l-arḍu","e":"the earth"},{"c":"أَثْقَالَهَا","d":"athqālahā","e":"its burdens"}],"a":{"g":"And the earth discharges its burdens"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالَ","d":"waqāla","e":"And says"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"man"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"What"},{"c":"لَهَا","d":"lahā","e":"(is) with it"}],"a":{"g":"And man says, \"What is [wrong] with it?\" -"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"That Day"},{"c":"تُحَدِّثُ","d":"tuḥaddithu","e":"it will report"},{"c":"أَخْبَارَهَا","d":"akhbārahā","e":"its news"}],"a":{"g":"That Day, it will report its news"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"بِأَنَّ","d":"bi-anna","e":"Because"},{"c":"رَبَّكَ","d":"rabbaka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"أَوْحَى","d":"awḥā","e":"inspired"},{"c":"لَهَا","d":"lahā","e":"[to] it"}],"a":{"g":"Because your Lord has commanded it."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"That Day"},{"c":"يَصْدُرُ","d":"yaṣduru","e":"will proceed"},{"c":"النَّاسُ","d":"l-nāsu","e":"the mankind"},{"c":"أَشْتَاتًا","d":"ashtātan","e":"(in) scattered groups"},{"c":"لِيُرَوْا","d":"liyuraw","e":"to be shown"},{"c":"أَعْمَالَهُمْ","d":"aʿmālahum","e":"their deeds"}],"a":{"g":"That Day, the people will depart separated [into categories] to be shown [the result of] their deeds."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَنْ","d":"faman","e":"So whoever"},{"c":"يَعْمَلْ","d":"yaʿmal","e":"does"},{"c":"مِثْقَالَ","d":"mith'qāla","e":"(equal to the) weight"},{"c":"ذَرَّةٍ","d":"dharratin","e":"(of) an atom"},{"c":"خَيْرًا","d":"khayran","e":"good"},{"c":"يَرَهُ","d":"yarahu","e":"will see it"}],"a":{"g":"So whoever does an atom's weight of good will see it,"}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"And whoever"},{"c":"يَعْمَلْ","d":"yaʿmal","e":"does"},{"c":"مِثْقَالَ","d":"mith'qāla","e":"(equal to the) weight"},{"c":"ذَرَّةٍ","d":"dharratin","e":"(of) an atom"},{"c":"شَرًّا","d":"sharran","e":"evil"},{"c":"يَرَهُ","d":"yarahu","e":"will see it"}],"a":{"g":"And whoever does an atom's weight of evil will see it."}}}